message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "japanese-rag-kotlin"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  On-device Japanese retrieval-augmented generation for Android and JVM in Kotlin: a pure-
  Kotlin core (ruri-v3 Unigram tokenizer that matches Hugging Face output, Japanese sentence
  chunker, in-memory vector index, retrieve-then-rerank pipeline) and an Android module
  running LiteRT conversions of ruri-v3 and Japanese rerankers.
repository-code: "https://github.com/masahiroid/japanese-rag-kotlin"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - rag
  - japanese
  - kotlin
  - android
  - litert
  - on-device
